* BALC -- runtime per-field color override demo.
* The map's COLOR= is the design-time default. The COBOL/REXX program
* paints STATUS in GREEN / RED at SEND MAP time via the -C suffix.
MAP BALC SIZE 24x80
  FIELD BALOUT AT 5,10 LEN 12 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=BLUE
  FIELD STATUS AT 7,10 LEN 10 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=NEUTRAL
ENDMAP
